OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fwill affect northern England and
OL,7,Fsouthern Scotland overnight. Elsewhere
OL,8,Fany showers will tend to become
OL,9,Ffocussed towards coasts, allowing some
OL,10,Fclear spells to develop. Patches of
OL,11,Ffog and frost forming, the fog dense
OL,12,Facross parts of southern England.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FFog and any frost will
OL,15,Fgradually clear on Remembrance Sunday,
OL,16,Fand patchy rain will generally become
OL,17,Fconfined towards northern England and
OL,18,Feastern Scotland. Otherwise some
OL,19,Fsunshine developing, in gentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
